        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.24.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 24.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now concerning the contribution for the saints: as I directed the churches of Galatia, so you also are to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.20.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 20.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.9.4+2CO.9.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 9.4-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " On the first day of every week, each of you is to put something aside and store it up, as he may prosper, so that contributions need not be made when I come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.8.18+2CO.8.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cor 8.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And when I arrive, I will send those whom you accredit by letter to carry your gift to Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it seems advisable that I should go also, they will accompany me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
