            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 15.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.19.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 19.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I will visit you after passing through Macedonia, for I intend to pass through Macedonia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and perhaps I will stay with you or even spend the winter, so that you may speed me on my journey, wherever I go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For I do not want to see you now just in passing; I hope to spend some time with you, if the Lord permits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 18.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But I will stay in Ephesus until Pentecost, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.19.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 19.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for a wide door for effective work has opened to me, and there are many adversaries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
