            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.31.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 31.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eph 6.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Be watchful, stand firm in your faith, be courageous, be strong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let all that you do be done in love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, brethren, you know that the household of Stephanas were the first converts in Achaia, and they have devoted themselves to the service of the saints; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I urge you to be subject to such men and to every fellow worker and laborer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I rejoice at the coming of Stephanas and Fortunatus and Achaicus, because they have made up for your absence; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for they refreshed my spirit as well as yours. Give recognition to such men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
